&oh=00_Af-N30kYGHJiYC0-pkSJyq6EYkRM_1SV07hP9NV40f58QQ&oe=6A297715"}, {"file_name": "Interview_01.png", "id": "558098475502894", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982460_558098478836227_2195642163881727498_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t7yvt0wXdSIQ7kNvwHD-Nzv&_nc_oc=AdoWS-Ciz8-TV0bSGWI-noo1LcMlu7cCmLqP6kznKkBaVbAbkgS6NvRQs2ytnxuDB3s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_rm5Ta_QFWIA-8dHd01gpZvbyuQbclfYCzLsp9sjsy7w&oe=6A295B4E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "JOb INterview Simulator (4).png", "id": "371985591479423", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035469_371985598146089_1320847157226308449_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tGyPW1wWhAoQ7kNvwE3jszY&_nc_oc=Adr3DxIC3MQDTvajsK2Em7Ul34syI4XRt0aI_a2RlHWLN5EcGQZFNxI13oUHKhO2N2M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-HEVV592HrvKneLG2rORTIwa-84qIHt897f7xTRzBxCQ&oe=6A295AD0"}, "display_name": "Job Interview Simulator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Proficient job interviewing craft is vital to attain the careers of our dreams. Unfortunately, it's difficult to practice this skill in a realistic way.\n\nThat's why we built the Job Interview Simulator. Simulate the entire interviewing process; from emailing HR before the interview, picking an outfit, arriving on time, catching the elevator, greeting the receptionist, and acing the interview. \n\nFeel the situational pressure of a Job Interview in an immersive virtual environent, and refine your interviewing craft with automated feedback. \n", "short_description": "Simulate the experience of a Job Interview in Virtual Reality. Practice and hone your interviewing craft in a safe setting, so you can ace your next job interview!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.workwindow.com.au/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.workwindow.co